    \uC9D1\uAE30)\n\r\nESC \uC77C\uC2DC\uC815\uC9C0 \uBA54\uB274"
  english: 'WASD Move

    

    LeftShift Run

    

    SpaceBar Dash (slide
    when running)

    

    Tab Inventory (click slots to grab)

    

    ESC
    Pause Menu'
